WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.420
Before you hand in writing, check the patterns you know.

00:00:04.420 --> 00:00:07.370
Did a silent e drop before a suffix?

00:00:07.370 --> 00:00:09.250
Did a y change to i?

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:11.330
Did a consonant double?

00:00:11.330 --> 00:00:15.700
Check one pattern at a time, and you’ll catch more.
